### 优化完整版
	Nowadays, taking online classes has become a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, online learning has both strengths and drawbacks
and should be carried out within proper limits.
	For one thing, online classes boost learning efficiency. Students and teachers can join courses anywhere with electronic devices, which saves a great deal of commuting time. 
For another, online learning has obvious shortcomings. Lacking face-to-face supervision, some students tend to get distracted or skip lessons for other activities.
	From my perspective, effective measures should be adopted to improve online courses. Teachers may conduct random spot checks to ensure students stay focused. Only in this way
can students acquire knowledge smoothly and benefit more from online education.
